comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-26T23:47:27.757Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: CI static gating now runs validate with both --check-storage-integrity and --check-history-drift under --strict-exit across the entire tracker, retaining one representative history command only as a smoke. A negative-control integration fixture corrupts a non-representative stream and proves the exact full-scan command exits nonzero. Health/validate also surface stale driver commands and unreviewed merge receipts."
  "2026-07-26T23:49:56.024Z","harness:codex","Final local verification: linked PM tests pass; full sandboxed suite passes 376 files and 6,437 tests at exact 100% statements (44,398/44,398), branches (31,515/31,515), functions (9,082/9,082), and lines (43,135/43,135). Lint, zero-duplicate scan, 100% docstring/static quality, SDK surface/import/transport ratchets, docs/skills, secret scan, npm audit, compatibility, packed npx, 88-command package-first dogfood, and Sentry 14-day zero-critical/zero-high gate pass. Live tracker strict validation checked 2,117 items and 2,128 history streams with zero drift, duplicate IDs, config errors, driver drift, or pending receipts. Telemetry successfully flushed to the configured endpoint at 2026-07-26T23:49:30.656Z."
  "2026-07-27T00:03:39.056Z","harness:codex","CI evidence from PR #758 exact head 659751094: history_drift checked 2,117 items with zero drift and storage scanned 2,128 streams clean, but strict storage status warned because all five clone-local driver keys were absent and ten fence entries came from locally contributed types unavailable in the clean runner. Fix will explicitly install drivers in the CI clone and assert the extension-independent committed fence remains unchanged."
  "2026-07-27T00:05:33.693Z","harness:codex","CI failure resolved locally: the static gate now runs pm merge install --no-extensions in the fresh clone, asserts git diff --exit-code for the committed extension-independent .gitattributes fence, then validates all history/storage and runs the representative smoke with extensions disabled. The generated fence removed ten locally contributed, non-schema-backed patterns. Focused workflow/runtime tests pass 14/14; the exact CI validate command is ok=true with history_drift and storage_integrity both ok and zero warnings; representative strict history verification exits 0."
learnings[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-26T23:47:28.467Z","harness:codex","A representative-stream smoke cannot establish repository integrity. CI must invoke the bulk drift scanner and strict storage validation, and its contract test must include a deliberately corrupted non-representative stream so future narrowing fails visibly."
  "2026-07-27T00:05:34.399Z","harness:codex","A clone-local driver audit cannot be strict in ephemeral CI until the clone runs pm merge install. Reproduce the committed fence with --no-extensions, assert it stays clean, and keep validation extension-independent so developer-global packages cannot influence repository integrity."
